WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone is about to start!

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:12.610
Kidou.

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:14.610
Gouenji.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.450
Sorry to call you here out of the blue.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:22.160
Kidou, there's something I need to tell you.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:28.000
Want to save Endou?

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:30.960
The late Endou?

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:32.590
Yeah.

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:34.450
We're going to bring him back...

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:36.970
From a world that's living in the wrong time.

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:19.820
Everyone, soccer is a dangerous and uncivilized sport.

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:21.850
For the sake of our children's future...

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:28.120
Please destroy soccer balls, uniforms, spikes, and such other items related to soccer at once.

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:30.670
This is...

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:35.340
Borrowing it from the future is nice and all, but none of us can read this.

00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:39.880
Well, it is a code that no one has been able to decrypt for years.

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:41.940
Code, huh...

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:43.850
But is this really writing?

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:46.060
If you ask me...

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:48.490
It certainly doesn't look like writing.

00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:49.690
In a way, it's heart.{いや、どんな意味だよ}{piisu and rabu~ kira}

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:54.270
But it should have the secrets to forming the strongest team in history in here.

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:55.690
Right!

00:02:55.690 --> 00:03:02.240
After all, whoever is able to read from Master D's holy book of champions will receive, in essence, the secret of soccer!

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:04.270
We'll read it through sheer force of will!

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:08.300
But you can't read what you can't read.

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:10.890
Master D... I wonder what sort of person he is.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:12.820
What era is he from?

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:15.530
That notebook could be from our time.

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:16.900
You have a point!

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:21.280
Then it'd be faster if we find Master D and ask him directly!

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:24.470
How are we supposed to do that when we don't even know who he is?!

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:26.420
That's true...

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:29.850
Have you decoded it yet?

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:31.860
We've brought snacks.

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:33.630
Yay!

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:35.940
Thanks, Aki-nee.

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:38.740
That's...

00:03:40.430 --> 00:03:41.930
What's the matter?

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:47.570
This handwriting is the same as the notebooks that Coach Endou had a long time ago.

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:49.770
Then is it Coach Endou's handwriting?

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:50.500
No...

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:55.420
The notebooks that Endou possessed and handled with great care were written by his grandfather.

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:59.000
He practiced diligently every day using the teachings of those notebooks.

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:02.500
Coach Endou's grandfather...

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:03.630
Then is this also...?

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:05.230
Yes.

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:08.370
I think it was written by his grandfather, Daisuke-san.

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:11.970
Then the "D" from Master D that Fei and the others talked about...

00:04:11.970 --> 00:04:13.960
It's the "D" from Endou Daisuke!

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.920
That's not a far gone conclusion.

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:19.860
So that's the identity of Master D who is known to us as the god of soccer?

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:21.640
I see!

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:23.950
So Endou's grandfather is Master D!

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:27.560
You can't see the forest for the trees!

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:29.440
So this is Daisuke-san's notebook!

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:30.670
It sure brings back memories!

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:34.750
Coach Endou is the only one who can read his handwriting.

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:38.670
Then we'll just get Coach Endou to read it for us!

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:41.100
We can't see Coach Endou.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:42.790
Right.

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:48.630
He's under a constant, strict surveillance, from when he is a child to the time he dies.

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:51.120
I hate to say it, but we can't be careless and approach him.

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:52.330
But there is a way.

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:55.560
We can ask the very person who wrote it.

00:04:56.090 --> 00:04:58.440
But his grandfather has passed away.

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:00.940
So we'll go to a time when he's still alive.

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:04.300
I see, we just have to go into the past!

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:05.780
What about the Artifact?

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:07.410
We have one right here.

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:08.710
Yeah!

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:15.580
What of the holy book of champions?

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:18.500
I'll have it back here immediately.

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:22.660
Einam.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:23.480
Reiza.

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:24.180
Quarth.

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:24.960
Gaura.

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:26.020
Zanou.

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:28.590
You have disappointed me.

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:32.460
Not only did you time jump unauthorized, but you came back defeated.

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:34.410
Our apologies.

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:36.940
I'm sending you to Infinity Prison.

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:39.230
Please wait.

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:43.470
They are regretful of their actions.

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:46.640
Why not give them one more chance?

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:51.820
All of them are well aware that they have no other way out.

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:54.830
Therefore, I'm sure they will be desperate to give it their all in battle.

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:56.410
Right?

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:00.940
Very well.

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:04.380
I'll put these five in your custody, Beta.

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.240
Yes, master.

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:09.330
Let's get going!

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:10.550
Keep your guards up!

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:13.550
Danger lurks in every corner!

00:06:17.550 --> 00:06:20.380
As I just demonstrated, you mustn't let your guard down!

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:23.710
Kidou-san!

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:26.740
I've heard the details from Gouenji.

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:30.660
Gouenji-san is doing a lot behind the scenes.

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:31.490
Yeah.

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:35.870
Let me help you bring back Endou.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:37.690
Kidou-san!

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:40.030
It's good to have you with us!

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:46.000
Okay then, let's head to the past to meet Endou Daisuke!

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:47.700
5...

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:48.300
4...

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:49.420
3...

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:50.630
2...

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:51.430
1...

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:53.430
Time jump!

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:59.180
Good luck, everyone.

00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:03.020
Go!

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:07.730
We're here.

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:10.280
This is where Master D is...

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:15.340
They're playing soccer!

00:07:15.340 --> 00:07:16.320
Yeah.

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:19.890
It feels like we haven't seen scenery like this in a long time.

00:07:21.010 --> 00:07:24.240
Soccer sure is great.

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:29.880
Still, it's way too hot here!

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:32.800
It doesn't look like we're in Japan.

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:36.560
This is the tropical country of the Tongattor Republic. {ﾄﾝｶﾞｯﾄﾙ}

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:39.870
Endou Daisuke is in this hospital.

00:07:41.050 --> 00:07:42.800
Is he ill?

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:44.100
It would appear so.

00:07:45.390 --> 00:07:46.790
I see...

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:49.550
How did it go?

00:07:49.550 --> 00:07:51.860
Daisuke-san's room is on the second floor.

00:07:52.290 --> 00:07:53.490
Then let's go!

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:54.450
Wait!

00:07:55.210 --> 00:07:58.890
I think it'll be a bother to him if we all went there at once.

00:07:58.890 --> 00:07:59.950
That's true...

00:08:01.490 --> 00:08:04.000
I'm the only one here who Daisuke-san knows.

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:06.660
I'll go see him first.

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:07.900
Then I'll go with you!

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:09.840
Let Kidou-san handle this one.

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:11.610
Okay...

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:14.080
Please see to it.

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:15.610
Where are they?

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:17.430
No need to fret.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:21.060
After all, those boys could never escape from me.

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:25.630
Never.

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:32.850
Excuse my intrusion.

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:34.110
Who's there?

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:36.110
It's been a while.

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:38.470
Oh, Kidou!

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:39.990
This brings back memories.

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:42.660
How are you feeling?

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:46.290
I'm starting to show my age.

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.170
It sure isn't fun getting old.

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:53.550
I'm glad that you seem in good health.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:58.720
But I never told anyone I was here.

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:02.280
I see, you must have heard about it from Mamoru.

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:04.960
I told him not to tell anyone.

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:08.700
Please look at this.

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:16.490
Why do you have that?

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:20.630
So it <i>was</i>  you who wrote it.

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:21.840
Yes.

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:28.380
It looks a lot more worn than I remember, but that's the notebook I left to Mamoru in my last will and testament.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:31.270
Did Mamoru give it to you?

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:34.970
Certain circumstances have happened to Endou and he isn't around right now.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.450
Certain circumstances...

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:40.300
Is it something you can't tell me?

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:45.480
I was told that this notebook contains the secret to forming the strongest soccer team in history.

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:47.520
I beg you.

00:09:48.490 --> 00:09:50.780
Please tell me what this notebook says.

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:53.190
Did something happen to Mamoru?

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:56.580
Don't tell me he's dead?!

00:09:56.580 --> 00:09:58.590
For now.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:03.830
But by knowing what this notebook says, there is a way to save him.

00:10:04.340 --> 00:10:06.510
Save Mamoru?

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:11.070
If we don't do something now, Endou's death will be a reality.

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:14.100
I don't understand what you're saying.

00:10:14.100 --> 00:10:16.300
I need to know what's written in here.

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:19.470
Please, you have to tell me.

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:22.250
Daisuke-san.

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:24.060
It isn't just Endou.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.730
At this rate, all of soccer will be lost.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:29.270
We can't afford to lose here.

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:35.330
No, I can't tell you what's inside.

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:38.240
Even if you knew, nothing will come of it.

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:41.270
There's nothing you can do with that information.

00:10:41.270 --> 00:10:42.450
Nothing we can do?

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:44.960
Besides, Kidou.

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:48.160
In soccer, getting stronger is nothing but the result.

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:54.700
Being able to enjoy competition, to become enthusiastic, to gain strength in both body and spirit...

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:56.060
That is soccer.

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:59.930
I thought that you would have understood this.

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:04.730
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:10.150
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:16.160
Okay, okay.

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:18.520
Hang in there a little longer.

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:22.520
No!

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:39.180
You're pretty amazing.

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:40.500
Nice skill you have.

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:41.680
Shinsuke, you're so kind.

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:50.640
Kidou-san!

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:56.020
It didn't go well?

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:56.920
Yeah.

00:11:56.920 --> 00:11:58.110
But we came so far.

00:11:58.810 --> 00:12:02.470
I didn't think he would refuse to tell us.

00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:03.110
What now?

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:06.870
Without deciphering the notebook, we're at a stalemate.

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:11.370
If he wouldn't agree when Kidou-san asked, it would be impossible for any of us.

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:14.170
Okay then, I'll go!

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:15.250
Huh?

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:17.380
It'll backfire.

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:22.880
If someone like you suddenly showed up and spoke, he'll run screaming for the hills!

00:12:30.110 --> 00:12:31.390
Who are you?

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:32.580
It's nice to meet you.

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:34.400
I'm Sorano Aoi.

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:38.810
I'm a manager of Raimon's soccer club led by Coach Endou.

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:41.940
Coach Endou?

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:44.670
You shouldn't speak lies, young miss.

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:46.840
Mamoru isn't a coach.

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:48.540
Well...

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:50.830
You may find this hard to believe...

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:55.810
But we came from a couple of years in the future.

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:57.330
Absurd!

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:01.490
In the future, Coach Endou is the best coach ever.

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:04.110
He made us number one in Japan.

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:05.800
Number one in Japan?

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:06.670
Yes.

00:13:06.670 --> 00:13:11.170
At any time, we can depend on him to cheer us up.

00:13:11.170 --> 00:13:13.910
Of course, he's my grandson!

00:13:14.340 --> 00:13:16.160
Oh, dear, dear.

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:18.380
Don't think you can try to fool me!

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:19.920
I'm not!

00:13:21.140 --> 00:13:24.860
Are you really Coach Endou's grandfather?

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:26.990
Of course!

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:29.320
Then you should understand.

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:36.230
Coach Endou once told us that what's most important to the coach is protecting the team.

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:37.870
How do you know that?

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:44.950
When we fought against an incredibly strong team called Zero, he saved us just like he always does.

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:48.580
He taught us to think about how we should use our own plays.

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:54.030
That's why everyone in Raimon carries on his will and fights to protect the team.

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:56.250
We fight to protect soccer.

00:13:57.170 --> 00:13:58.810
Please understand!

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:02.190
We don't want to lose Coach Endou or soccer!

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:13.730
You said your name was Aoi?

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:14.160
Yes.

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:21.380
Very well, I'll tell you about the invincible eleven I've written about in this notebook.

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:22.650
Really?!

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:25.960
But you will never be able to assemble these eleven.

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:30.150
After all, they are members who are impossible to assemble.

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:32.370
Impossible to assemble?

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:35.560
It's nothing but a dream of mine I put to paper, to begin with.

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:39.720
My last dream as I pursued the most supreme form of soccer.

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:41.610
Grandpa...

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:45.360
Let's go. I want to talk to the others.

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:47.430
Then...!

00:14:47.430 --> 00:14:49.330
Endou Daisuke-san!

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:50.820
It's time to take your temperature.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:54.360
Hey, you're trying to slip out again, aren't you!

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:57.430
You caught me!

00:14:57.430 --> 00:14:58.720
Honestly!

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:00.880
You need to keep quiet in bed!

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:04.310
Goodbye now. Tell everyone I said hi.

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:07.280
I'll catch up with you later.

00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:08.320
Okay.

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:09.630
Did you say something?

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:11.970
No, nothing at all, nothing at all!

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:18.220
We'll just have to spend time persuading him and getting him to understand.

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:22.850
But if the changes in the timeline get fixed while we're doing that...

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:24.060
That's...!

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:29.530
Look out, it's them!

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:32.240
They followed us!

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:37.700
It seems that my members caused quite a stir with you the other day.

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:39.250
How did you know we were here?

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:42.920
Give us back the holy book of champions.

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:46.250
So they noticed our actions.

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:48.420
Matsukaze Tenma.

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:50.260
We will beat you this time.

00:15:50.640 --> 00:15:51.300
Let's fight!

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.130
Guys!

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:00.350
Oh no...

00:16:10.640 --> 00:16:13.130
Okay! The coach for this match is...

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:15.870
Kidou-san, please be our coach.

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:17.670
Okay.

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:20.470
Nishizono, I want you in defense.

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:23.330
Throw the enemy off with your jumping.

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:24.460
Yes, sir!

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:26.710
Don't let it get to you, Wondeba-san.

00:16:28.360 --> 00:16:30.420
Honey, hurry up with that yakisoba!

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:30.920
Got it!

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:33.550
Honey!

00:16:34.150 --> 00:16:36.470
We have an order for okonomiyaki too!

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:39.060
He disappeared again...

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:44.190
Whoa, my yakisoba spatulas turned into a mic!

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:55.520
Five members of Raimon, including Fei and the Dupli to make eleven, go up against Protocol Omega 2.0 led by Beta!

00:16:55.520 --> 00:17:00.580
With the holy book of champions that will shape the future of soccer on the line, neither of them can afford to lose this game!

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:03.080
Well, let's start.

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:04.750
Beta kicks off!

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:05.750
The ball goes to Einam!

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:09.500
Let's go!

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:16.470
Wonder Trap!

00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:20.220
You won't get through me!

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:22.890
Reiza steals it back!

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:23.770
Tenma!

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:25.230
Quarth!

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:27.520
And the ball goes to Quarth!

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:31.320
He easily dodges Straw and crosses enemy lines!

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:32.350
Shinsuke!

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:33.070
Okay!

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:33.860
I won't let you!

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:37.110
Offense Command 04!

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:39.530
<Spinning Upper>

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:43.030
What incredible drive...

00:17:43.030 --> 00:17:43.660
Yeah.

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:46.700
Quarth springs out to the front of the goal!

00:17:46.700 --> 00:17:48.440
Quarth! Over here!

00:17:48.440 --> 00:17:49.610
Einam!

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:55.420
Shoot Command 06!

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:57.840
<Plasma Ball>

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:00.630
C'mon!

00:18:04.940 --> 00:18:06.730
Excellent Breast!

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:12.430
Goal!

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:15.740
Protocol Omega 2.0 makes the first goal!

00:18:17.010 --> 00:18:18.240
They got us!

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:22.030
They're taking it so personally.

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:32.940
Let's go!

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:35.170
Here they come.

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:37.760
The ball goes to Shindou!

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:42.720
Tenma!

00:18:44.400 --> 00:18:44.850
Okay!

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:46.810
I'll stop you here!

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:51.270
I'll use Avatar Armed!

00:18:57.280 --> 00:19:00.160
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:04.740
Not happening!

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:07.450
Armed!

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:18.130
Matsukaze fails to use Avatar Armed!

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:21.630
Tenma, focus!

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:23.970
Quarth!

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:28.140
Reiza!

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:31.190
Einam!

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:33.730
A fierce pass goes to Einam!

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:35.020
Defense!

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:35.310
Okay!

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:39.690
He gets through!

00:19:43.360 --> 00:19:44.650
Take this!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.240
I want to shoot too.

00:19:48.550 --> 00:19:49.810
Is that all right?

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:54.720
This is how you use Avatar Armed.

00:19:56.720 --> 00:19:57.380
Come out!

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:02.720
Goddess of the Vacant Skies, Athena!

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:05.010
Armed!

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:20.530
Shoot Command 07!

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:21.530
<Double Shot>

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.560
Goal!

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:33.730
Protocol Omega 2.0 wins their second point!

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:37.250
The first half ends here!

00:20:37.570 --> 00:20:40.760
Daisuke-san, have you finished your IV bag?

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:43.050
Daisuke-san?!

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:45.470
What do we do...

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:49.710
At this rate, we'll be beaten before we even have a chance to decipher the notebook.

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:52.880
What's with those depressed looks!

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:55.550
Grandpa!

00:20:55.550 --> 00:20:57.050
Grandpa?

00:20:57.050 --> 00:20:59.330
He's Coach Endou's grandfather.

00:20:59.330 --> 00:21:00.230
Him?!

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:02.840
So you're Master D!

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:04.530
Master D, eh?

00:21:05.770 --> 00:21:08.490
Is that how I'm called in the future?

00:21:09.860 --> 00:21:13.000
Then you believe us?

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:15.350
Of course.

00:21:18.010 --> 00:21:20.230
You all have a good look in your eyes.

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:21.960
All right!

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:25.130
I'll be the coach for this game!

00:22:54.130 --> 00:22:57.350
Daisuke-san's super-dimensional orders take front seat!

00:22:57.350 --> 00:22:59.390
Look at our hissatsu tactics!

00:22:59.890 --> 00:23:03.730
Next, Find Them! The Strongest Eleven In History?!

00:23:03.730 --> 00:23:05.360
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.150 --> 00:23:19.340
The Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone's proverb today is...

00:23:21.620 --> 00:23:27.780
Being able to enjoy yourself, to become enthusiastic, to gain strength in both body and spirit. That is soccer!

00:23:27.780 --> 00:23:29.080
That's all!
